    "pmc8371488_l12_taniborbactam_boronate": "L12:Bicyclic boronate derivatives (taniborbactam / VNRX-5133, QPX7728) have proven to be good mimetics of tetrahedral transition state analogs in both serine- and metallo-β-lactamase (NDM-1) catalyzed carbapenem hydrolysis.",
