    "pmc13722051_l17_opm_meg_rb87_serf": "L17:Optically pumped magnetometers (OPMs) use an alkali vapour (87Rb) heated to ~150 C and operate in the spin-exchange relaxation-free (SERF) regime, enabling cryogen-free wearable clinical neuroimaging and cardiac magnetometry."
